description = "Made by a Chain that starts with {n:catch} and ends with Kick. Throws the enemy you caught {b:THROW_DISTANCE} m away from you for {hit} Physical damage; it and every enemy within {b:THROW_SPLASH} m of where it lands are knocked down for {b:KICKED_DOWN_TIME} sec. A boss can't be thrown: it takes a Reversal instead, {dt:REVERSAL_COEF} Physical damage."
